s/origins/34fddfa7-c6f1-4a06-b9a0-d838e017a660?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&blur=200&s=d2d2169dc74cafabd4ae0e82d39dfd38, https://si.imgix.net/e393fa65/uploads/origins/34fddfa7-c6f1-4a06-b9a0-d838e017a660?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=2&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&blur=200&s=2ae8310b9dee08b503f6b2b06048c15d 2x, https://si.imgix.net/e393fa65/uploads/origins/34fddfa7-c6f1-4a06-b9a0-d838e017a660?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=3&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&blur=200&s=169045a27c6b3354debb504a59be9744 3x"}, "body": "想要有關藍綠色蝴蝶的感覺，暗色之中帶著點綴的麟分——。整體就是一看有骷髏以及華麗又性感成熟的歌德風，看得出來有智慧以及賢者的模樣，縱然本質是怪盜，但顏色可以在黑暗之中有五彩斑斕的咒語或是魔藥、魔法陣也可以展現歌德風的神秘感和當代的煉金術先進、花的部分則是想選貼近的乾燥花，亦或是變出的鮮花、想要藍柑橘就像是就像roselia的紗夜所代表的顏色和感覺，氣質部分其實是小惡魔……雖然對人友善但還是有小惡魔的一面，希望裙擺是長的就像婚紗一樣，日常也可以但結婚也可以的服飾！", "nc": 16, "word_count": 0, "transcoder": "image", "creator_acceptable_same_genre": true}, {"path": "/@isapeed/works/3", "private_thumbnail_image_urls": null, "private": false, "genre": "art", "tipped": false, "creator_id": 3168095, "client_id": 1346861, "vtt_url": null, "thumbnail_image_urls": {"src": "https://si.imgix.net/e9ba3549/uploads/origins/a72bd784-dcc9-45d0-ab04-ba0eaa8e7756?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=4ee61b3f10a3500ac46f988f1be8d73a", "srcset": "https://si.imgix.net/e9ba3549/uploads/origins/a72bd784-dcc9-45d0-ab04-ba0eaa8e7756?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=4ee61b3f10a3500ac46f988f1be8d73a, https://si.imgix.net/e9ba3549/uploads/origins/a72bd784-dcc9-45d0-ab04-ba0eaa8e7756?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=2&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=3d32b4de0f750983bfa5bff1e0e2d8b2 2x, https://si.imgix.net/e9ba3549/uploads/origins/a72bd784-dcc9-45d0-ab04-ba0eaa8e7756?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=3&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=fbfc8cef35ef3c60e46ff4f6261f342d 3x"}, "duration": null, "nsfw": false, "hardcore": false, "consored_thumbnail_image_