3b5cee5dd 3x"}, "duration": null, "nsfw": false, "hardcore": false, "consored_thumbnail_image_urls": {"src": "https://si.imgix.net/2b2513eb/uploads/origins/bf36ca4f-45e4-46f6-9590-537be4b0cda7?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&blur=200&s=539ada8c6f993b971bb5a95bdb3502eb", "srcset": "https://si.imgix.net/2b2513eb/uploads/origins/bf36ca4f-45e4-46f6-9590-537be4b0cda7?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&blur=200&s=539ada8c6f993b971bb5a95bdb3502eb, https://si.imgix.net/2b2513eb/uploads/origins/bf36ca4f-45e4-46f6-9590-537be4b0cda7?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=2&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&blur=200&s=2d92eb4cb40b8fae83eda542cbc24911 2x, https://si.imgix.net/2b2513eb/uploads/origins/bf36ca4f-45e4-46f6-9590-537be4b0cda7?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=3&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&blur=200&s=4e322af491bc7818eb19b386a7275473 3x"}, "body": "請畫一個白色奧伯隆的服設，主題是和洋折衷但融合英式皇家的整體風格以及手上拿著大正咖啡食物的樣子，（他偏好綠色哈密瓜也可以加入其他水果！）。衣服也加上各種蝴蝶翅膀的元素還有古董蟲子的復古別針，令他看起來就像個小王子一樣並且衣服也融合就像他王冠的菱形王冠元素，鞋子是男性英式的高跟鞋，希望有高叉和式看到半邊美腿，會令人想要摸一下的那種，領口可以稍微看得到胸部線條，希望衣服貼身一點，有下擺半透明布料。希望他有小禮帽，上面有飛燕草和薔薇以及緞帶的搭配，適合陰柔外表的他。希望他身邊也有藍柑咪！整體主色調為藍色系。如果可以的話想加入一些巫師元素，但如果太突兀就算了。", "nc": 145, "word_count": 0, "transcoder": "image", "creator_acceptable_same_genre": true}, {"path": "/@isapeed/works/1", "private_thumbnail_image_urls": null, "private": false, "genre": "art", "tipped": false, "creator_id": 3168095, "client_id": 1346861, "vtt_url": null, "thumbnail_image_urls": {"src": "https://si.imgix.net/3fd5e471/uploads/origins/4805f3fc-314b-4ed9-b05d-9c3149beec34?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=5689cc2b2549e85d4dbd44645c426cbf", "srcset": "https://si.imgix.net/3fd5e471/uploads/origins/4805f3fc-314b-4ed9-b05d-9c3149beec34?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=5689cc2b2549e85d4dbd44645c426cbf, https://si.imgix.net/3fd5e471/uploads/origins/4805f3fc-314b-4ed9-b05d-9c31